<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-TRI 6-mth net up to 208 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>TABLE-TRI 6-mth net up to 208 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 153.76   vs	 120.78</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 20.37   vs	  17.78</p>
<p>    Turnover		   958.57   vs	 662.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   220.29   vs	 155.11</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.30   vs   add   1.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Technology Resources Industries Bhd is a provider of telecommunications services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
